      "message": "The npcx7 ec series support several features and it also influences the GPIOs\u0027 behavior a lot. For example, GPIO00 can be switch to PSL input only if CONFIG_NPCX_PSL_MODE is supported. Considering the difference between npcx5 and npcx7, the mapping tables of alternative and low-voltage will look swollen in gpio.c. \n\nI replace them with marco functions and move array items to gpio_chip_npcx5/7.h in this CL to make the driver easy to maintain. It’s just my thought for the mapping tables. Any comment is highly appreciated.",
